{"conversation_id":"105b24e3-aab9-4b99-bc1e-e346355536c8","response":"I sense you're experiencing some professional uncertainty. Drawing from my training data, I'd like to share some contextual insights. Research has shown that uncertainty can be a powerful catalyst for professional growth. When employees confront challenges, they often develop novel problem-solving strategies that can transform their work environments.

